ent.com/in/946600?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-pull-request-reviewer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR implements SSH policy security fixes to align with Tailscale's security model, addressing issues #3009 and #3010. The changes introduce strict validation rules for SSH source/destination combinations and remove support for wildcard destinations.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Removes wildcard (`*`) as an SSH destination - users must now use `autogroup:member`, `autogroup:tagged`, or specific tags/users\n- Adds validation preventing tags/autogroup:tagged from SSHing to user-owned devices\n- Adds validation requiring username destinations to have the same single user as source\n- Adds comprehensive test coverage for all validation rules\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 7 out of 7 changed files in this pull request and generated no comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| hscontrol/policy/v2/types.go | Adds SSH validation errors, `validateSSHSrcDstCombination()` function, and updates UnmarshalJSON/MarshalJSON to reject wildcard in SSH destinations |\r\n| hscontrol/policy/v2/types_test.go | Updates existing tests to use valid SSH patterns and adds comprehensive validation test cases covering all security rules |\r\n| hscontrol/policy/v2/filter_test.go | Updates SSH user mapping tests to use tagged destinations instead of username destinations |\r\n| hscontrol/policy/policy_test.go | Updates SSH policy tests to use valid patterns (groups to tags instead of groups to users) |\r\n| integration/ssh_test.go | Updates integration tests to use autogroup:member/tagged instead of wildcard, corrects TestSSHMultipleUsersAllToAll behavior, adds TestSSHPolicyValidationErrors for validation testing |\r\n| CHANGELOG.md | Documents breaking changes with clear examples of invalid and valid patterns |\r\n| .github/workflows/test-integration.yaml | Adds TestSSHPolicyValidationErrors to the integration test workflow |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/juanfont/headscale/new/main/.github/instructions?filename=*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.","commit_id":"abaea5269dc2f174cf8e8a6fb62725f870b14088","state":"commented","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3028#pullrequestreview-3687780255","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3028","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3028#pullrequestreview-3687780255"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3028"}},"submitted_at":"2026-01-21T15:15:09Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T15:15:09Z","author_association":"NONE","event":"reviewed"},{"sha":"9a1ae17996085de726c03d773bca6f01be0e4baf","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDlhMWFlMTc5OTYwODVkZTcyNmMwM2Q3NzNiY2E2ZjAxYmUwZTRiYWY","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/9a1ae17996085de726c03d773bca6f01be0e4baf","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/9a1ae17996085de726c03d773bca6f01be0e4baf","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-21T12:14:43Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-21T15:28:46Z"},"tree":{"sha":"7b326ae309ce3076303e35bc2c930b181454904d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/7b326ae309ce3076303e35bc2c930b181454904d"},"message":"policy/v2: validate SSH source/destination combinations\n\nAdd validation for SSH source/destination combinations that enforces\nTailscale's security model:\n\n- Tags/autogroup:tagged cannot SSH to user-owned devices\n- autogroup:self destination requires source to contain only users/groups\n- Username destinations require source to be that same single user only\n- Wildcard (*) is no longer supported as SSH destination; use\n  autogroup:member or autogroup:tagged instead\n\nThe validateSSHSrcDstCombination() function is called during policy\nvalidation to reject invalid configurations at load time.\n\nFixes #3009\nFixes #3010","parents":[{"sha":"4e1834adaf0021c8ed22c3404ccbb081f9390ac7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/4e1834adaf0021c8ed22c3404ccbb081f9390ac7","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/4e1834adaf0021c8ed22c3404ccbb081f9390ac7"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"3f49ef9f1aa9af888ab333d80365e992f248ce25","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDNmNDllZjlmMWFhOWFmODg4YWIzMzNkODAzNjVlOTkyZjI0OGNlMjU","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/3f49ef9f1aa9af888ab333d80365e992f248ce25","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/3f49ef9f1aa9af888ab333d80365e992f248ce25","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date"